  "result": "Perfect! All **488 tests pass**. The renderInvoiceText enhancement is complete. Here's a summary:\n\n## Enhanced Invoice Text Rendering\n\n**Enhancements Made**:\n\n1. **Line Discounts** - Each line with a discount now shows the discount amount in parentheses:\n   ```\n   9 x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac765.00 (\u20ac36.46 discount)\n   ```\n\n2. **Discount Summary Line** - When the invoice has any discounts (line discounts or bulk discounts), a summary line appears:\n   ```\n   Discount: \u20ac36.46\n   ```\n\n3. **Voucher Display** - If a voucher is applied, it appears just before the Total:\n   ```\n   Voucher: -\u20ac10.00\n   Total: \u20ac1,234.56\n   ```\n\n4. **Due Date** - When the invoice has a due date, it appears after the Total:\n   ```\n   Total: \u20ac1,234.56\n   Due: 2025-02-14\n   ```\n\n5. **Payment History** - When payments have been recorded, the total amount paid appears after the Due date:\n   ```\n   Total: \u20ac1,234.56\n   Due: 2025-02-14\n   Paid: \u20ac500.00\n   ```\n\n**Output Order**:\n```\n[Invoice Number]\n[Customer Name]\n[Line 1] with optional discount notation\n[Line 2] with optional discount notation\n...\n[Discount line - if any discounts exist]\n[VAT line - if VAT > 0]\n[Voucher line - if voucher applied]\nTotal: \u20acX.XX\nDue: YYYY-MM-DD [optional]\nPaid: \u20acX.XX [optional]\n```\n\n**Test Coverage - 11 New Tests**:\n- Line discounts display\n- Discount summary lines\n- Voucher display\n- Due date display\n- Payment tracking\n- Complete invoice with all features\n- Edge cases (no discounts, no payments, etc.)\n- Line ordering verification\n- Discount shown with bulk discount (qty >= 10)\n\n**Result**: \u2713 **488/488 tests passing** (477 previous + 11 new tests for enhanced rendering)",
